#MOBILE
Vnum       40101
Keywords   tem madog master temple forge~
Short      Tem Madog~
Long       Tem Madog stands over an anvil, hammer in hand.
~
Desc       Broad-shouldered and scarred by decades of forge-work, Tem Madog is
the Master of Vur Tepe. He speaks little, preferring to let the ring of
his hammer say what needs saying. Initiates who earn his respect earn
it one blade at a time.
~
Race       Human~
Position   standing~
DefPos     standing~
Gender     male~
Actflags   npc sentinel~
