#MOBILE
Vnum       40102
Keywords   forge smith instructor~
Short      a forge-smith instructor~
Long       A forge-smith instructor tends the coals, watching the apprentices work.
~
Desc       Soot-streaked and patient, this instructor has spent more years
at Vur Tepe's forges than most initiates have been alive. They correct
grip and stance with a word, never a shout.
~
