#ROOM
Vnum     40101
Name     Gate of Vur Tepe~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     Heat rolls out from Vur Tepe's gate long before you reach it, the
air itself shimmering above the stone threshold. Smoke curls from
chimneys set into the mountainside beyond, and the distant ring of
hammer on steel never quite stops. A path leads north into the forge
hall proper.
~
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    40102
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    40926
#ENDEXIT
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40102
Name     Forge Hall~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     Rows of anvils fill this vast, smoke-blackened hall, each tended by
an apprentice hard at work. Chains suspend half-finished blades over
banked coals, and the heat is a physical, pressing thing. This is the
beating heart of Vur Tepe.
~
#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    40101
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    40103
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction east~
ToRoom    40105
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction west~
ToRoom    40106
#ENDEXIT

Reset M 0 40103 2 40102
Reset O 0 40101 5 40102
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40103
Name     The Quenching Pool~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     A long stone trough runs the length of this narrow chamber,
filled with dark, still water. A newly-forged blade plunged here
hisses and steams, the shock of the quench deciding as much of its
final temper as the hammer-work ever did. The air smells faintly of
hot iron.
~
#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    40102
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction up~
ToRoom    40104
#ENDEXIT
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40104
Name     Tem Madog's Chamber~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     Spare and unornamented, this chamber sits above the forge hall,
close enough that the ring of hammers below never fully fades. A
single completed blade hangs above a modest cot - Tem Madog's first,
kept as a reminder of how far a novice's hands still have to travel.
~
#EXIT
Direction down~
ToRoom    40103
#ENDEXIT

Reset M 0 40101 1 40104
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40105
Name     Crystal Vault~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     Small alcoves line the walls of this cool, quiet room, each
holding a handful of raw, uncut crystals set aside for hilts still to
be made. Unlike the forge hall's heat and noise, this room is kept
deliberately still - the crystals, it's said, respond better to a
calm hand.
~
#EXIT
Direction west~
ToRoom    40102
#ENDEXIT

Reset O 0 40102 5 40105
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40106
Name     Apprentice Workshop~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     Smaller and quieter than the main forge hall, this workshop is
where apprentices practice the basics before they're trusted near the
real anvils - filing, fitting, and the long, patient work of learning
where a blade's balance actually lives.
~
#EXIT
Direction east~
ToRoom    40102
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    40107
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    40108
#ENDEXIT

Reset M 0 40103 1 40106
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40107
Name     Experimental Chamber~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     Set apart from the rest of Vur Tepe, this chamber holds a scatter
of half-finished projects unlike anything else in the forge - hilts
built for something other than a plain blade, and diagrams that speak
of channeling a crystal's focus into a blade of pure light rather than
folded steel. The work here is young, and far from finished.
~
#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    40106
#ENDEXIT
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40108
Name     Materials Store~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     Stacked ingots of raw steel and rarer ore fill this cramped
storeroom, sorted with more care than the clutter first suggests. An
apprentice's first lesson at Vur Tepe is learning where everything
here actually belongs.
~
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    40106
#ENDEXIT
#ENDROOM

#ENDAREA
